# Practice Problem: Write a program with a reusable static method named isEven that takes an integer and returns true if it is even and false if it is odd

#code 

public class Main {
    static Boolean isEven(int a ){
        boolean even = false;
        if (a % 2 == 0){
            even = true;
        }
        return even;
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(isEven(50));
    }
}
